<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai security forces killed an insurgent trainer and a suspect in separate Yala operations near the Malaysian border, while another insurgent was killed in a Yala security action close to Malaysia. The Thai Air Force scrambled F-16 fighter jets to the Tak border in response to cross-border attacks from Myanmar, and evacuation centres are being prepared for possible refugee flows from Myanmar. Thailand placed ten border provinces on alert over fighting in Myanmar and is reviewing land-border entry rules for Malaysia, while border provinces face smuggling, livestock trafficking and antique looting. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsNation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQR2l1eVhINzRnM2ZQSV91YnN3M3IxbUdreEMyTkQ1QWhIMWhxcEtmOHlRc1p1SC0yYUtYeXFtaE04WG9qaXltRF9hUFVJbW1QVFNyb2tDSWRzbjh4dXZXZmhJNWZ2SlBNX3pDOGUtR2xJOS1PU0puWVpiWHY0NFFoTW13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBPOTF0TGJPbUZJQ0Ywb3Z3Zzh0ajZRbmtnYW1GTlplLWJsNndEcVQyLXFXY2c0SGZvbkd3RDlQX0IxRnp1WnZKMHJzQldNQWZ5LW16cDBxV1ItTHM5WGVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQQUJYS1hXNkt5UUs3VDAtUEJiNlgwUzFiT3BOWUtnMldMZlFQQW8zSkZHdkJZd2JIMzdrdGRvQ2l5TlI3eENZdmhsNE5aM2JxX3dXaUJiRlVPOUJUTDRsYmI1YnM1REowbzdoTFRFU0tPejg5NU5paGhRYkxKR29lemtnQWJNOGtVU3FFVWdKNlYzejBtNHUxc1U2VnkzZjJmNDBHNUZZSDBkYWlXSWlYNHRWWlRxZWcwRUVQblpoNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Phnom Penh Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNZ3FxUFJ5VVhEQzQ3